'''''Dawn, Shine at the World's End''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Fall at Dawn's Rise]].

==Steps==
# Head to the "Lightless Chapel" Dawncloud and continue your adventure
# Use Oronyx's Prayer to move the rubble
# Get down the mountain
# Obtain Kephale's Coreflame
# Unlock the Arcane Seal to open the Coreflame Casket
# Obtain Kephale's Coreflame
# Continue forward and return to Marmoreal Palace
# Escape quickly and return to Marmoreal Palace

