===Head to the "Lightless Chapel" Dawncloud and continue your adventure{{subst:void|<!--104041001-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Lightless Chapel" Dawncloud|I created a passage to the Vortex of Genesis with spirit water. Hyacine will claim Aquila's divine authority and bid farewell to everyone. Meanwhile, we'll rush back to Okhema to provide support.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Dan Heng:''' The sky is burning.
:'''Phainon:''' Okhema's Dawn has come to an end...
:'''Phainon:''' Why is this happening...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can Hyacine fix the sky...
::'''Phainon:''' No... it's too late. This sky has been completely swallowed by the black tide...
::'''Phainon:''' This darkness... Its power probably surpasses that of the Titans.
::Was this not predicted in the prophecy?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Was this not predicted in the prophecy?
:'''Phainon:''' Tribbie would have made sure to warn us if there were any mention of it.
:'''Phainon:''' Even if Hyacine takes the divine authority of the sky, she probably won't be able to banish this darkness...
:'''Phainon:''' The black tide... its power probably surpasses even that of the Titans.
:'''Phainon:''' All we can do is hope she can protect as many lives as possible...
:{{tx}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Phainon:''' The transport platform's route is blocked by rubble...
:'''Phainon:''' (Trailblazer)! Help buy us some time!
{{Dialogue End}}

