===Obtain Kephale's Coreflame{{subst:void|<!--104041004-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Lightless Chapel" Dawncloud|update|Evernight has descended upon the holy city, bringing disturbing chaos in its wake. With just one final Coreflame to return, completing the "Era Nova" may be our only choice in this crisis. After retrieving Kephale's Coreflame, we will immediately head to the Vortex of Genesis.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Caenis:''' O Sky Father Kephale, please forgive these ignorant and lowly children of humanity...
:'''Caenis:''' They are so utterly naive that they think of the golden-blooded heretics as Deliverers...
:'''Caenis:''' This bloodred sky, and the raging flames and demons throughout the land, will purge their foolishness...
:'''Phainon:''' Caenis...
:'''Caenis:''' Ah... Lord "Deliverer"?
:'''Caenis:''' Why don't you join me in praying to the benevolent Kephale...?
:'''Caenis:''' Cast your eyes on this ravaged land... All of this, sins committed by you blasphemous heretics...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She... looks like she's got a screw loose.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Mm... We should not waste our time on a pitiful madwoman.
::Time to avenge Aglaea.
::'''Dan Heng:''' ...
::'''Dan Heng:''' We have more important matters to attend to... We shouldn't waste our time on a pitiful madwoman.
::You are turning everything upside down!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Time to avenge Aglaea.
::'''Dan Heng:''' ...
::'''Dan Heng:''' We have more important matters to attend to... We shouldn't waste our time on a pitiful madwoman.
::You are turning everything upside down!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You are turning everything upside down!
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...No need to argue. We're just wasting our time on a pitiful madwoman.
:'''Phainon:''' Dan Heng is right. My sword yearns to end your pathetic life...
:'''Phainon:''' But to a cornered dog like you, the most deserving punishment is to personally witness the Chrysos Heirs fulfill their mission.
:'''Phainon:''' Only then... will you truly know how meaningless and foolish your past transgressions were.
:'''Caenis:''' Heh... Fulfill your mission?
:'''Caenis:''' Kephale's Coreflame is long lost to the winds. How will you... fulfill the prophecy?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Lost to the winds...?
:'''Phainon:''' She's gone completely mad... to the point where she's just spewing nonsense.
:'''Phainon:''' For the longest time, Kephale's Coreflame has been worshiped here... Only core members of the Council of Elders know how to activate the Coreflame Casket.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How're we gonna find a core member now?
::'''Phainon:''' No... There's no need for such trouble.
::We'll just have to force Caenis to help us.
::'''Phainon:''' No... We don't need her help.
::That Lygus, should we seek him out?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We'll just have to force Caenis to help us.
::'''Phainon:''' No... We don't need her help.
::That Lygus, should we seek him out?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That Lygus, should we seek him out?
:'''Phainon:''' No... There's no need to go through that effort.
:'''Phainon:''' Professor Anaxa taught me more than just what was in the textbooks.
:{{tx}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Dan Heng:''' Hyacine... Did she make it?
:'''Phainon:''' Her will to heal the world is so strong...
:'''Phainon:''' We'll definitely sense it if she's succeeded.
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Dan Heng:''' Is that...
:'''Phainon:''' ...A "Cleaner"!?
{{Dialogue End}}

